<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The macro is designed to assist with aiming in first-person shooter games on a PC with a screen resolution of 1920x1080. It does not affect the vertical recoil of guns, but it completely removes any side recoil.

To use the macro, the player should set their in-game sensitivity to 3 and their DPI to 600 for all guns. The macro will then automatically activate when aiming down sights, helping the player to stay on target without any unwanted horizontal recoil.</Description>
    <Comment>This is the actual original made by me, i previoslu uploaded wrong macro!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
